edgelist is extracted from the observed object at every time step; without
\code{tergmLite}, the \code{networkDynamic} object is used as stored. Network
statistics are recorded through \code{nwstats.formula} in \code{\link[=control.net]{control.net()}}, with
the default \code{"formation"} meaning \code{~edges}. \code{\link[=netdx]{netdx()}} refuses a \code{netcensus}
object, since there is no model to diagnose; \code{print} summarizes the
